{
 "type":"excalidraw","version":2,"source":"https://excalidraw.com","appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":null},"files":{},
 "elements":[
 {"id":"title","type":"text","x":50,"y":35,"width":1760,"height":65,"text":"Vertex AI / One controlled path for every call","fontSize":40,"fontFamily":1,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"thesis","type":"text","x":52,"y":115,"width":1750,"height":65,"text":"검색과 작성을 분리하고, 재시도와 전송 기록을 한 곳에서 관리한다.\n새 bundle 생성 경로 · 논리 호출 6개 = 조사 2 + 작성 3 + 종합 1 (실제 전송 수는 재시도·단계 생략에 따라 달라짐)","fontSize":21,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"research-card","type":"rectangle","x":50,"y":225,"width":550,"height":265,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1,"strokeWidth":2,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"research-text","type":"text","x":75,"y":245,"width":500,"height":115,"text":"A. 조사 / discovery_people · discovery_outlook\n입력: 경기·팀·D0 DB 문맥 + 조사 프롬프트\n출력: 후보 URL + 검색 기반 요약\n검색 요약 자체를 기사 원문으로 취급하지 않음","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"research-config-bg","type":"rectangle","x":75,"y":375,"width":500,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"research-config","type":"text","x":92,"y":390,"width":470,"height":65,"text":"tools: [{google_search: {}}]\nresponse_mime_type: application/json\ntemperature: 0.2","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#22c55e","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"writer-card","type":"rectangle","x":650,"y":225,"width":610,"height":265,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"transparent","roughness":1,"strokeWidth":2,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"writer-text","type":"text","x":675,"y":245,"width":560,"height":115,"text":"B. 작성 / 주목 선수 · 부상 · 매체 + 종합 전망\n입력: InformationBundle의 본문 구간·요약·DB 문맥\n종합 전망은 앞선 섹션의 구조화 결과도 사용\n출력: 섹션 JSON → 인용 연결·정본 변환","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"writer-config-bg","type":"rectangle","x":675,"y":375,"width":560,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"writer-config","type":"text","x":692,"y":390,"width":525,"height":65,"text":"tools 없음 · temperature: 0.2\nresponse_mime_type: application/json\nmax_output_tokens: 40000  (전송 횟수와 별개)","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#22c55e","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"scope-title","type":"text","x":1320,"y":235,"width":480,"height":40,"text":"병렬 그래프 ≠ 전역 호출 제한","fontSize":25,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"scope-slot1","type":"rectangle","x":1325,"y":290,"width":65,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1},
 {"id":"scope-slot2","type":"rectangle","x":1405,"y":290,"width":65,"height":35,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1},
 {"id":"scope-slot-label","type":"text","x":1490,"y":293,"width":310,"height":30,"text":"run마다 슬롯 2개","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"scope-text","type":"text","x":1320,"y":350,"width":480,"height":140,"text":"ConcurrencyLimiter / BoundedSemaphore\n조사·작성 호출 전체를 감싼다.\n429 대기 중에도 슬롯을 점유한다.\n배당 조립도 통과하나 모델 호출은 0회.\n여러 run의 총동시성은 이 제한 밖이다.","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"research-to-provider","type":"arrow","x":325,"y":495,"width":0,"height":80,"points":[[0,0],[0,80]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"writer-to-provider","type":"arrow","x":955,"y":495,"width":0,"height":80,"points":[[0,0],[0,80]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"provider-boundary","type":"rectangle","x":50,"y":580,"width":1750,"height":330,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeStyle":"dashed","backgroundColor":"transparent","roughness":1,"strokeWidth":2},
 {"id":"provider-heading","type":"text","x":75,"y":605,"width":1690,"height":40,"text":"provider.request_model → execute_request     재시도 판단은 이 어댑터 한 곳에서만","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"budget","type":"rectangle","x":80,"y":675,"width":265,"height":145,"strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"budget-label","type":"text","x":97,"y":692,"width":235,"height":120,"text":"1  RunBudget\ncan_attempt → charge\nlock 안에서 재판정·차감\n논리 모듈별 전송 상한\n거부 시 전송하지 않음","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"ledger","type":"rectangle","x":400,"y":675,"width":265,"height":145,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","roughness":1,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"ledger-label","type":"text","x":417,"y":692,"width":235,"height":120,"text":"2  전송 전 장부\n_journal / send_ledger\n별도 세션·트랜잭션 commit\n기록 실패 → 전송 중단\n예약 ≠ 전송 성공 확정","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"sdk","type":"rectangle","x":720,"y":675,"width":265,"height":145,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"sdk-label","type":"text","x":737,"y":692,"width":235,"height":120,"text":"3  google-genai SDK\nvertexai=True\nHttpRetryOptions\n(attempts=1)\nSDK 내부 재시도 OFF","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"vertex","type":"ellipse","x":1040,"y":675,"width":265,"height":145,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ddd6fe","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1,"strokeWidth":2},
 {"id":"vertex-label","type":"text","x":1075,"y":711,"width":200,"height":80,"text":"4  Vertex AI\nGemini 3.5 Flash\nlocation: global","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.35},
 {"id":"response","type":"rectangle","x":1360,"y":675,"width":410,"height":145,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"hachure","roughness":1,"roundness":{"type":3}},
 {"id":"response-label","type":"text","x":1380,"y":692,"width":370,"height":120,"text":"5  응답 판정·기록\nHTTP 분류 / ContentCheck\n독립 응답 journal → _record_attempt\n성공: 호출자에 반환 → 정본 변환·저장\n실패: 아래 정책으로 재전송 또는 종료","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"budget-ledger","type":"arrow","x":350,"y":748,"width":45,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[45,0]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"ledger-sdk","type":"arrow","x":670,"y":748,"width":45,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[45,0]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"sdk-vertex","type":"arrow","x":990,"y":748,"width":45,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[45,0]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"vertex-response","type":"arrow","x":1310,"y":748,"width":45,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[45,0]],"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"retry-loop","type":"arrow","x":1565,"y":825,"width":1350,"height":55,"points":[[0,0],[0,55],[-1350,55],[-1350,0]],"strokeColor":"#b45309","strokeWidth":2,"roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"retry-loop-label","type":"text","x":500,"y":842,"width":830,"height":30,"text":"재전송 조건을 만족할 때만 대기 → 다음 attempt_ordinal에서 예산 재확인","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#b45309","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"policy-title","type":"text","x":55,"y":960,"width":1000,"height":40,"text":"오류의 종류가 다르면 다음 행동도 다르다","fontSize":27,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"policy-header","type":"text","x":65,"y":1025,"width":1000,"height":30,"text":"상황                           전송 상한 · 다음 행동","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"policy-line1","type":"line","x":55,"y":1060,"width":1000,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[1000,0]],"strokeColor":"#64748b","roughness":1},
 {"id":"policy-429","type":"text","x":65,"y":1075,"width":1000,"height":60,"text":"429 / rate_limited             직전 실패가 429일 때만 4번째 전송 허용\n                               시도 순서별 60 / 300 / 600초 · 더 긴 공급자 안내 우선","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#b45309","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"policy-transient","type":"text","x":65,"y":1145,"width":1000,"height":35,"text":"503 · timeout 등 일시 오류      최대 3전송 · 지수 대기 + jitter · 대기 상한 60초","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"policy-permanent","type":"text","x":65,"y":1195,"width":1000,"height":35,"text":"400/401/403/404/422             같은 요청 재전송하지 않고 종료","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#b91c1c","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"policy-content","type":"text","x":65,"y":1245,"width":1000,"height":35,"text":"MAX_TOKENS · JSON 해석 실패     내용 거부 기록 · 같은 모듈의 3전송 상한 안에서 재시도","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"policy-quality","type":"text","x":65,"y":1295,"width":1000,"height":35,"text":"글 길이 · 근거 수 부족          이것만으로 자동 재전송하지 않음 · 부족 결과로 구분","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"trace-title","type":"text","x":1135,"y":960,"width":665,"height":40,"text":"어느 시도의 응답으로 만든 본문인가?","fontSize":25,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"trace-key-bg","type":"rectangle","x":1135,"y":1025,"width":665,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"trace-key","type":"text","x":1155,"y":1040,"width":625,"height":60,"text":"preview_attempts 고유 키\n(run_id, logical_call_id, attempt_ordinal)","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#22c55e","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"trace-chain","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1140,"width":660,"height":165,"text":"section_result.module_execution_ids\n    → module_execution → attempts\n    → request_artifact_id / response_artifact_id\n\n시도별 HTTP 상태 · error_class · wait_ms · usage · 시각\n장부: preview_write_audit (실행 롤백과 별도 commit)","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"timeline-label","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1310,"width":660,"height":30,"text":"정책 예시 — 실제 실행 기록이 아님","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"timeline","type":"arrow","x":1170,"y":1395,"width":580,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[580,0]],"strokeColor":"#64748b","roughness":1,"endArrowhead":"arrow"},
 {"id":"attempt0","type":"ellipse","x":1160,"y":1385,"width":20,"height":20,"strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"attempt1","type":"ellipse","x":1415,"y":1385,"width":20,"height":20,"strokeColor":"#b45309","backgroundColor":"#fef3c7","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"attempt2","type":"ellipse","x":1730,"y":1385,"width":20,"height":20,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","roughness":1},
 {"id":"timeline-captions","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1355,"width":660,"height":30,"text":"0: 429           60초       1: 429        300초       2: 200","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#374151","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"timeline-note","type":"text","x":1140,"y":1415,"width":660,"height":30,"text":"attempt_ordinal은 0부터 · 3전송 ≠ 3재시도","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.3},
 {"id":"budget-separation","type":"text","x":65,"y":1370,"width":1000,"height":80,"text":"AI 전송 몫  ≠  기사·배당 HTTP 몫  /  서로 차감 안 됨\nHTTP: 기사 보호 10 + 배당 보호 10 + 공유 10 = 총 30\n모델 6개는 각자 전송 상한을 가짐 · 배당 섹션은 모델 호출 0회","fontSize":19,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"limits-divider","type":"line","x":50,"y":1495,"width":1750,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[1750,0]],"strokeColor":"#64748b","strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":1},
 {"id":"argument","type":"text","x":55,"y":1530,"width":830,"height":125,"text":"설계 의도\n검색 도구는 조사에만 → 작성 입력의 근거를 추적\nSDK 재시도 off → 어댑터에서 실제 전송 시도를 집계\n전송 전 장부 → 후처리 롤백에도 전송 예약·응답 근거 보존","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#047857","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"limits","type":"text","x":980,"y":1530,"width":820,"height":125,"text":"보장 범위의 한계\n전역 Vertex 쿼터·여러 run 합산 동시성은 제한하지 않음\n요청당 timeout 300초 · 새 생성은 실행 전체 기한 미강제\n모든 섹션 완성·사실 정확성·운영 성공을 보장하지 않음","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.4},
 {"id":"footer","type":"text","x":55,"y":1710,"width":1750,"height":75,"text":"소스: provider.request_model / execute_request · retry.RunBudget / ConcurrencyLimiter · discovery · bundle_sections · send_ledger · models\n모델·global: 배포 보고서 preview-generation-release-2026-11-19.md §설정 근거 / 제품 017bca2\n설정 발췌는 키·값만 축약한 설명용 표기. 이 그림은 구조 설명이며 새 모델 호출·DB 조회·운영 E2E를 수행하지 않았다.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"strokeColor":"#64748b","lineHeight":1.4}
 ]
